<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 5.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 5.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    94/95    101/102     UNQ     181/184</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   97/98    103/105   190/192   198/202</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes moved up marginally on Thursday amid average enquiries, traders said, but shipowners were not keen in buying. A supplier said he fixed a parcel at $97 per tonne, the same as his previous selling level.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
